# Cloudflare static-asset headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
# Read by Cloudflare only: `astro preview` and the tests ignore this file, so `pnpm check:production`
# proves it against the live site (ADR 0045).
#
# Both patterns are content-hashed file names: a change of content is a change of name, so the
# response can be cached for a year and never revalidated.

/search-index.*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
